# graft's cards are gitignored but should stay greppable: ripgrep reads
# .ignore before .gitignore, so this re-admits the tree to search only.
!graft/
graft/.cache/
graft/.graph/
# Dated specs, plans and research are history (docs/README.md): default searches skip them so an agent does not take
# an old design for today's behaviour. A search that names the path still reads them.
docs/superpowers/
docs/research/
